WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:06.240 line:90%,end
The year 2300. The Shadow's fortress rises in the darkest corner of the Broken Isles.

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.360 line:90%,end
Leon's voice is coming from there.

3
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.720 line:90%,end
Four young rebels, an AI, and a single goal.

4
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.480 line:90%,end
To bring Leon back.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.920 line:90%,end
Six robots are patrolling the north tower.

6
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.840 line:90%,end
The east gate is weaker.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.240 line:90%,end
The fortress shields reset every 90 seconds.

8
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.580 line:90%,end
That short gap is our only chance.

9
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.410 line:90%,end
90 seconds is more than enough for us.

10
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.760 line:90%,end
I'll distract them.

11
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.180 line:90%,end
The Shadow's robots aren't as fast as me.

12
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:38.460 line:90%,end
Six? I was expecting ten. What a letdown.

13
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.200 line:90%,end
Eray, no jokes this time. We're all coming back. Deal?

14
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.760 line:90%,end
I remember this fortress. They put me to sleep here.

15
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.640 line:90%,end
The shield is opening! Now! Run!

16
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.280 line:90%,end
30 seconds left. The shield is closing again.

17
00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.850 line:90%,end
Hey! Metal heads! Over here!

18
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.340 line:90%,end
Eray, two more robots on your right. Duck!

19
00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.160 line:90%,end
I see them, I see them. Trust me a little.

20
00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.440 line:90%,end
Eray, get through the gate. Now!

21
00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.540 line:90%,end
Everyone stay close to me. Be quiet.

22
00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:10.700 line:90%,end
A security drone is approaching. Don't move.

23
00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.160 line:90%,end
Hold your breath.

24
00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:19.270 line:90%,end
I used to see these corridors in my dreams. I know every step.

25
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.250 line:90%,end
Left corridor. The capsules are below. On the lowest floor.

26
00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:26.130 line:90%,end
Careful! The Shadow's signal is very close.

27
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.120 line:90%,end
Somewhere around here.

28
00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.530 line:90%,end
Welcome, 23. I've been waiting for you.

29
00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.270 line:90%,end
Stop hiding, Shadow. Where is Leon?

30
00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:37.690 line:90%,end
Leon is mine now. Just as you soon will be.

31
00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.770 line:90%,end
The door is locked. There's no other way out.

32
00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:44.250 line:90%,end
I found a way. A ventilation shaft. Right above you.

33
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:48.430 line:90%,end
The shaft is too narrow. Eray, get your foot out of my face.

34
00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:51.370 line:90%,end
Sorry. It's impossible to turn around in here.

35
00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:55.360 line:90%,end
There's a huge room below. The temperature is minus 10 degrees.

36
00:01:55.410 --> 00:02:00.410 line:90%,end
Deep in the fortress, 22 sleeping souls were waiting.

37
00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.090 line:90%,end
Look, exactly 22 capsules.

38
00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:07.670 line:90%,end
They all have life signs. And one of them is Leon's.

39
00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.230 line:90%,end
Do you like my capsules, 23? They're all my work.

40
00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:15.210 line:90%,end
Leon, can you hear me? I'm getting you out of here.

41
00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:18.950 line:90%,end
AyShe, you have to go. This is a trap.

42
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.940 line:90%,end
Warning. Energy in capsule 22 is rising rapidly.

43
00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.990 line:90%,end
Too late. The doors have closed.

44
00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.230 line:90%,end
AyShe, careful. Capsule 22 is opening.

45
00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:35.350 line:90%,end
And what came out of capsule 22 was not what any of them expected.

